      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Ryan are delighted to present this attractive three-bedroom detached residence, ideally positioned at Ballymaquirk on the N72 Killarney Road, Kanturk, Co. Cork. Offering approximately 90 sq.m. of well-proportioned accommodation, this charming home combines privacy, character and excellent connectivity, making it an appealing choice for first-time buyers, downsizers, investors or those seeking a peaceful countryside setting within easy reach of local amenities.\n\nThe property is approached via a gated entrance and occupies a private, secure site with fully walled boundaries and a sheltered garden area. The outdoor space offers excellent privacy and is well suited to families, pet owners or those looking to enjoy a quieter rural lifestyle. Two external sheds provide valuable additional storage.\n\nInternally, the accommodation is bright and welcoming, with the impressive double-height ceiling in the living room creating a wonderful feeling of space and providing a striking focal point. The living room also features a stove and useful storage. The fitted kitchen is practical and well presented, while the property benefits from triple-glazed windows throughout, helping to enhance comfort and energy efficiency.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a porch, spacious living room, fitted kitchen, three bedrooms and two bathrooms, including an en-suite facility. The three bedrooms offer flexibility for family living, guest accommodation or a home office, depending on the purchaser's requirements.\n\nAccommodation:\n\nPorch: 2.5m x 1.8m, tiled\nLiving Room: 4.9m x 5.3m, tiled, double-height ceiling, stove and storage\nKitchen: 3.1m x 2.1m, tiled, fitted units\nBathroom: 1.9m x 2.2m, tiled, electric shower\nBedroom 1: 3.7m x 2.9m, tiled\nBedroom 2: 3.7m x 2.1m, tiled\nBedroom 3: 4.3m x 2.6m, carpeted, built-in wardrobe\nEn-suite: 1.7m x 2.1m, with bath\nThe location is a particular highlight. Situated directly on the N72 Killarney Road, the property enjoys excellent road connectivity while retaining a peaceful rural atmosphere. Kanturk town is only a short drive away and offers a wide range of amenities including schools, shops, cafés, restaurants and sporting facilities. Banteer Train Station is also within easy reach, providing a convenient rail connection towards Cork City and beyond.\n\nThe property is serviced by mains water and a septic tank, with oil-fired central heating. It is being offered to the market vacant and chain free, providing an excellent opportunity for a straightforward purchase.\n\nWith its distinctive double-height living space, secure private garden, detached layout, excellent connectivity and proximity to Kanturk and Banteer, this property represents an attractive opportunity for a wide range of purchasers.\n\nKey Features:\n\nThree-bedroom, two-bathroom detached residence\nApprox. 90 sq.m.\nImpressive double-height living room\nStove in living room\nTriple-glazed windows throughout\nOil-fired central heating\nMains water and septic tank\nPrivate, secure walled garden\nGated entrance\nTwo external storage sheds\nExcellent N72 Killarney Road location\nClose to Kanturk town\nConvenient to Banteer Train Station\nVacant and chain free\nC 0.15 Acres\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment with DNG Ryan.\n\nThese particulars have been prepared by DNG John Ryan and whilst every care has been taken to ensure that these are accurate and correct, we are not responsible for any errors, omissions, inaccuracies, if the property is let, sold or withdrawn from sale or if it is not suitable for your purpose. These particulars are for information only and are given under the strict understanding that they do not form part of any contract. Neither whole nor any part of this document or any reference thereto may be included in any public document, circular or statement nor published without the written consent of DNG John Ryan. PSL: 003615"
      },
